          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>R, S, T each hold {(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)} on their respective columns. Joining on B=C AND D=E and enumerating every match: R(0,1)xS(1,0)xT(0,1)-&gt;(A=0,F=1,C=1,D=0); R(0,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=0,F=0,C=1,D=1); R(0,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=0,F=1,C=1,D=1); R(1,0)xS(0,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=1,F=0,C=0,D=1); R(1,0)xS(0,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=0,D=1); R(1,1)xS(1,0)xT(0,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=1,D=0); R(1,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=1,F=0,C=1,D=1); R(1,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=1,D=1). Grouping these 8 rows by (A,F): group (0,1) has 2 rows (C sum=1+1=2, D sum=0+1=1); group (0,0) has 1 row (dropped by HAVING COUNT(*)&gt;1); group (1,0) has 2 rows (C sum=0+1=1, D sum=1+1=2); group (1,1) has 3 rows (C sum=0+1+1=2, D sum=1+0+1=2). After HAVING filters out the single-row group (0,0), the remaining three groups are exactly (0,1,2,1), (1,0,1,2), (1,1,2,2) — option B.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>R, S, T mỗi quan hệ đều chứa {(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)} trên các cột tương ứng. Join theo B=C AND D=E rồi liệt kê từng tổ hợp khớp: R(0,1)xS(1,0)xT(0,1)-&gt;(A=0,F=1,C=1,D=0); R(0,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=0,F=0,C=1,D=1); R(0,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=0,F=1,C=1,D=1); R(1,0)xS(0,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=1,F=0,C=0,D=1); R(1,0)xS(0,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=0,D=1); R(1,1)xS(1,0)xT(0,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=1,D=0); R(1,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,0)-&gt;(A=1,F=0,C=1,D=1); R(1,1)xS(1,1)xT(1,1)-&gt;(A=1,F=1,C=1,D=1). Gộp 8 dòng này theo (A,F): nhóm (0,1) có 2 dòng (tổng C=1+1=2, tổng D=0+1=1); nhóm (0,0) có 1 dòng (bị loại bởi HAVING COUNT(*)&gt;1); nhóm (1,0) có 2 dòng (tổng C=0+1=1, tổng D=1+1=2); nhóm (1,1) có 3 dòng (tổng C=0+1+1=2, tổng D=1+0+1=2). Sau khi HAVING loại nhóm chỉ có 1 dòng (0,0), ba nhóm còn lại chính xác là (0,1,2,1), (1,0,1,2), (1,1,2,2) — phương án B.</p></div>"
